			"date": "2024-11-06T15:24:46.258Z",
			"content": "<p>Trying to think what's the most vulnerable aspect of it. The protocol is open and technically anyone can fork the app and spin up their own version, right?</p>\n<p>I guess loosing access to the Bluesky hosted Personal Data Server would be the main risk?</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:3igpi3ld7xp7qghifa4frpq6/app.bsky.feed.post/3lac2qp4foc2w",
