			},
			"date": "2024-11-06T15:30:50.920Z",
			"content": "<p>Nice to see someone talking about it but *whew* that’s a lot of pieces someone will have to set up, develop, and maintain (for just the server piece)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lac2we5bvf2s",
