		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:z3uoukoxwd2je3nxpdv45jzk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lac2zmgch62c",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/brob.dev/post/3lac2zmgch62c",
			"author": {
				"name": "Bryan Robinson",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/brob.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z3uoukoxwd2je3nxpdv45jzk/bafkreif5pdmagb65ngah4xs257gahckg2uy7mjclfyne5h75jf26zy4jdq"
			},
			"date": "2024-11-06T15:33:59.452Z",
			"content": "<p>There's always a critical mass in the \"engagement economy\" and that will always make it come crashing down :(</p>\n<p>It's not valuable enough when it's small, but to get big enough to truly be valuable to us, takes it VERY close to that critical mass</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:3igpi3ld7xp7qghifa4frpq6/app.bsky.feed.post/3lac2zsndwf2z",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lac2xrdbpc2p",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cferdinandi.bsky.social/post/3lac2zsndwf2z",
			"author": {
				"name": "Chris Ferdinandi",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cferdinandi.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3igpi3ld7xp7qghifa4frpq6/bafkreigesw6pqw7k4vdepohvqgy5ej3vuz2m23mhhmbs3d7bhkapuxqg2e"
			},
			"date": "2024-11-06T15:34:05.972Z",
			"content": "<p>TBF, I think Mastodon has a similar danger profile, despite being disparate instances. It's still mostly controlled by one person who manages the largest and most popular instances on the platform.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lac33lhdpc2r",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:3igpi3ld7xp7qghifa4frpq6/app.bsky.feed.post/3lac2zsndwf2z",
